<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/claim/morphoeval-cooke-clock-and-wavefront> a pk:Claim ;
    rdfs:label "Cooke & Zeeman (1976) clock-and-wavefront somite segmentation (Xenopus laevis & Gallus gallus vertebrate paraxial mesoderm somites)" ;
    dct:conformsTo <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/math-law/cooke-clock-and-wavefront-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/math-law/cooke-clock-and-wavefront-2>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/math-law/cooke-clock-and-wavefront-3>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/math-law/cooke-clock-and-wavefront-4>,
